      "jcr:created": "Wed Sep 01 2021 18:24:08 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<p>We recently held our first global diversity, equity and inclusion (DE&amp;I) summit for Stryker employees. The summit challenged all of us to be the difference: for ourselves, for our colleagues, for our customers and for our communities. Learn how our employees are taking what they learned and are turning it into action to advance DE&amp;I at Stryker.</p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Four inspiring ways our employees will</span> <span class=\"futura-bold\">advance diversity, equity and inclusion</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 08 2021 14:00:00 GMT+0000",
